<view class="page">
 <view class="hero"><view class="eyebrow">名远教育 · 一对一成长计划</view><view class="hero-title">每一步成长，都有专属陪伴</view><view class="hero-child" wx:if="{{child}}"><text class="child-dot"></text>{{child.studentName}} · {{child.gradeName}}<text class="child-price" wx:if="{{quote}}">¥{{quote.unitPrice}} / 基础次</text></view><view class="hero-caption">每包15次 · 每节2小时 · 确认线下收款后入账</view></view>
 <view class="error" wx:if="{{error}}">{{error}}</view><view class="loading" wx:if="{{loading}}">正在同步孩子信息与课包报价…</view>
 <view class="card" wx:if="{{child}}">
  <view class="section-heading"><view class="heading">选择成长课包</view><text class="section-caption">多包更优惠</text></view>
  <view class="packages"><button class="package {{packageCount == item.count ? 'selected' : ''}}" wx:for="{{packages}}" wx:key="count" data-count="{{item.count}}" bindtap="chooseCount" disabled="{{submitting || retrying || loading}}"><view class="package-discount">{{item.discount}}</view><view class="package-credits">{{item.credits}}<text>次</text></view><view class="package-label">{{item.label}}</view><view class="package-count">{{item.count}} 个课包</view><view class="package-choice">{{packageCount == item.count ? '已选择 ✓' : '选择课包'}}</view></button></view>
  <view class="quantity-row"><view><view class="quantity-title">购买数量</view><view class="muted">每包15次，最多100包</view></view><view class="stepper"><button bindtap="adjustCount" data-delta="-1" disabled="{{submitting || retrying || loading || packageCount <= 1}}">−</button><text>{{packageCount}}<text class="quantity-unit"> 包</text></text><button bindtap="adjustCount" data-delta="1" disabled="{{submitting || retrying || loading || packageCount >= 100}}">＋</button></view></view>
  <view class="quantity-hint">{{packageCount >= 3 ? '本单已享9折优惠' : packageCount == 2 ? '本单已享92折优惠' : '本单已享95折优惠'}}<text wx:if="{{quote}}"> · 共 {{quote.credits}} 个基础次数</text></view>
 </view>
 <view class="card coupon-card" wx:if="{{child}}"><picker range="{{couponOptions}}" value="{{couponIndex}}" bindchange="chooseCoupon" disabled="{{submitting || retrying || quoting || loading}}"><view class="coupon-row"><view class="coupon-icon">券</view><view class="coupon-copy"><view class="quantity-title">专属优惠券</view><view class="muted coupon-name">{{couponOptions[couponIndex]}}</view></view><text class="chevron">›</text></view></picker><view class="coupon-note">折后再抵扣 · 仅限无学科、无指定课程限制的通用券</view></view>
 <view class="card price-card" wx:if="{{quote}}"><view class="section-heading" bindtap="toggleBreakdown"><view class="heading">费用明细</view><text class="details-toggle">{{showBreakdown ? '收起 −' : '展开 ＋'}}</text></view><view class="price-saving"><view><view class="muted">本次已优惠</view><view class="saving-value">课包 −¥{{quote.packageDiscount}}<text wx:if="{{quote.couponDiscount !== '0.00'}}"> / 券 −¥{{quote.couponDiscount}}</text></view></view><view class="credits-pill">{{quote.credits}} 次</view></view>
  <view class="breakdown" wx:if="{{showBreakdown}}"><view class="line">基础单价<text>¥{{quote.unitPrice}} / 次</text></view><view class="line">课包原价<text>¥{{quote.grossAmount}}</text></view><view class="line">课包优惠<text>−¥{{quote.packageDiscount}}</text></view><view class="line">折后金额<text>¥{{quote.subtotal}}</text></view><view class="line">优惠券抵扣<text>−¥{{quote.couponDiscount}}</text></view><view class="line total">最终应付<text>¥{{quote.payableAmount}}</text></view></view>
 </view>
 <view class="pending-card" wx:if="{{retrying && pending}}"><view class="heading">原购买待核对</view><view>{{pending.packageCount}} 包 · 原应付 ¥{{pending.expectedPayableAmount}}</view><view class="muted">购买参数已保留，重试仍是同一笔订单，请勿重复购买。</view></view>
 <view class="purchase-notes"><view class="note-title">购课小贴士</view><view>精英教师每节扣1次，资深教师每节扣2次；基础次数不等于实际可上课节数。</view><view>提交后联系教务线下缴费，收款确认后进入当前孩子账户。</view><view>课包余额退款暂未开放，请联系教务咨询。</view><button class="refresh" wx:if="{{!retrying}}" bindtap="onPullDownRefresh" disabled="{{loading || submitting}}">重新获取报价 ↻</button></view>
 <view class="purchase-bar"><view class="bar-main"><view class="bar-amount"><view class="bar-label">{{retrying ? '原订单应付' : '最终应付'}}</view><view class="bar-price" wx:if="{{retrying && pending}}"><text>¥</text>{{pending.expectedPayableAmount}}</view><view class="bar-price" wx:elif="{{quote}}"><text>¥</text>{{quote.payableAmount}}</view><view class="bar-waiting" wx:else>{{quoting || loading ? '正在试算…' : '待确认报价'}}</view></view><button class="buy-button" bindtap="buy" loading="{{submitting}}" disabled="{{submitting || (!retrying && (loading || quoting || !quote))}}">{{retrying ? '重试原购买' : '提交购买'}}<text wx:if="{{!retrying}}">线下缴费 · 确认后入账</text></button></view></view>
</view>
